      "reason": "s0384 explicitly names Emperor Hui and s0387 continues the same imperial captivity episode. The full later genealogy s0410 names Xiaowu as the emperor and says Chong was followed by his son Hui (子惠立). Existing p242 owns that son, with Hui/惠 names, Chinese mention, male/attestation facts and the p241 parent edge. Move only the existing English Hui occurrence to p242 and remove the incorrectly associated s0410 evidence from p214 name/ruler/sex claims; no name, role or date is invented."
